d JSON):** Convert the gathered points into clear, concise JSON key-value pairs. (Self-Correction: Ensure all strings are quoted and data types are correct.)\n\n7.  **Final Review:** Does this meet the requirement? Yes, it is about Lisbon, and it is in valid JSON format. (Output the final result.)User wants facts about Lisbon as JSON. Provide valid JSON."}

